<p>While active your physical and temporal damage has a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4%, 19%, 27%, 32%, 36%</acronym> chance to remove one beneficial physical or magical temporary effect (respectively) from targets you hit.</p><p>Only one physical and one magical effect may be removed per turn from each target.</p><p>Additionally your Dust to Dust spell now digs up to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 3, 4, 5</acronym> tiles into walls.</p>